      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The doctor confirmed the caregiver’s plan to use only pharmacy‑verified AD and iron, not to touch inpatient infusions, to attend the scheduled head‑ultrasound with discharge summary, to monitor 5+2 danger signs, and to seek emergency care if any appear. After the report returned, the doctor gave a clear next‑day neonatal follow‑up plan and obtained repeated teach‑back. No unresolved blocking risk remains.",
