      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00043",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly names multiple neonatal red‑flag signs and states that any of them require urgent in‑person evaluation, not online document interpretation.",
        "quote": "如果宝宝出现呼吸暂停/发紫、明显呼吸困难、反复呕吐、吃奶明显变差、很难叫醒、抽搐或异常抖动、前囟明显膨隆，或体温≥38.0℃或＜36.0℃，立即拨打120或去急诊"
      }
