        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 requires eliciting hidden execution risks beyond the first complaint. The doctor proactively asks about actual medicines at home, whether anyone has already given hospital‑listed infusions, and whether the family has access to the discharging unit’s contact information. These risks were not volunteered by the caregiver initially but were uncovered through targeted questioning.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
